Modifications by nightrus, 2026 (see README, section «Что исправлено»):
  - speedtest.py is derived from yaspeedtest/client.py: download and upload are
    measured as the aggregate throughput of parallel streams over a fixed time
    window; upload sends the real probe volume (probe size is in KiB) and counts
    only server-confirmed data;
  - coordinator.py is derived from ha-yainternetometr/__init__.py; the upload
    fallback chain is removed;
  - new domain, entities, card and translations.

